{"seq":50,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1725"},"reason":"Extended the paragraph on rare phobias with coulrophobia (a modern coinage, adopted by the Oxford Dictionary of English in 2010) and added it to the table.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evil_clown"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1015],["+"," Some names are not ancient at all: coulrophobia, the fear of clowns, is a modern coinage that spread through informal lists of phobias and was adopted by the Oxford Dictionary of English only in 2010, its prefix usually traced to the Greek kolobathron, a stilt. Researchers link it to the painted face that hides a clown's real expression, and horror figures such as Pennywise in Stephen King's It have only fed it."],["=",158],["+","\n| coulrophobia | modern coinage, Greek kolobathron, stilt | clowns |"],["=",136]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",993],["+"," Manche Namen sind gar nicht antik: Die Coulrophobie, die Angst vor Clowns, ist eine moderne Wortschöpfung, die sich über inoffizielle Phobielisten verbreitete und erst 2010 in das Oxford Dictionary of English aufgenommen wurde; ihre Vorsilbe wird meist auf das griechische kolobathron, Stelze, zurückgeführt. Forscher bringen sie mit dem geschminkten Gesicht in Verbindung, das den wahren Ausdruck eines Clowns verbirgt, und Horrorfiguren wie Pennywise aus Stephen Kings „Es“ haben sie zusätzlich genährt."],["=",160],["+","\n| Coulrophobie | moderne Wortschöpfung, griechisch kolobathron, Stelze | Clowns |"],["=",130]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",873],["+"," Некоторые названия вовсе не древние: коулрофобия — страх, который вызывают клоуны, — это современное словообразование, распространившееся через неофициальные списки фобий и включённое в Oxford Dictionary of English лишь в 2010 году; её приставку обычно возводят к греческому kolobathron, ходуля. Исследователи связывают этот страх с раскрашенным лицом, скрывающим настоящие эмоции клоуна, а персонажи ужасов вроде Пеннивайза из романа Стивена Кинга «Оно» лишь подпитывают его."],["=",156],["+","\n| коулрофобия | современное слово, греч. kolobathron, ходуля | клоуны |"],["=",114]]}],"hash":"54fda0ed7dce"},
{"seq":51,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f27901"},"reason":"New question on coulrophobia, the fear of clowns, the best-known modern phobia name, rounding off the article's survey of named phobias.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evil_clown"},{"url":"https://www.npr.org/2013/08/06/209494071/fear-of-clowns-yes-its-real"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"clowns"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Clowns"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"клоуны"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[3047,6],"de":[3487,6],"ru":[3230,6]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"2010","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The Oxford Dictionary of English adopts the word coulrophobia","labelDe":"Das Oxford Dictionary of English nimmt das Wort Coulrophobie auf","labelRu":"Oxford Dictionary of English включает слово «коулрофобия»"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evil_clown","title":"Evil clown – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"6fed9d0e33ce"},
